-- P2-2 from the DB audit (binary-sleeping-mist).
-- All DateTime columns -> TIMESTAMPTZ(6). Existing values are
-- naive timestamps assumed to be UTC (the backend stamps with
-- new Date(), which is UTC-internally), so we coerce with AT
-- TIME ZONE 'UTC' to make the absolute meaning explicit.
--
-- 122 columns across 52 tables.

